as somebody who is defining culture;

00:51:21.100 --> 00:51:22.570
if he wears something, it's cool;

00:51:22.570 --> 00:51:25.060
it doesn't matter what he does, it's cool,

00:51:25.060 --> 00:51:26.900
it's defining culture.

