00:51:32.570 --> 00:51:34.660
but the way that he's just kind of doing

00:51:34.660 --> 00:51:37.180
what he wants to do musically.

00:51:37.180 --> 00:51:38.013
Yeah.

00:51:38.013 --> 00:51:41.380
And also the fact that he's so focused.

00:51:41.380 --> 00:51:44.180
So this is another thing about
each person on this list.

00:51:45.670 --> 00:51:47.440
For me, one of the things I'm jealous of

00:51:47.440 --> 00:51:49.163
is people who have a focus.

00:51:50.660 --> 00:51:51.560
We don't have a focus.

00:51:51.560 --> 00:51:54.593
We have like 12 jobs, right?

00:51:56.760 --> 00:51:57.910
But everybody on this list,

00:51:57.910 --> 00:52:00.980
they do this one thing really
to really, really well.

00:52:00.980 --> 00:52:03.600
That's why John Mayer can play the guitar

00:52:03.600 --> 00:52:04.770
like a complete badass

