of coming back to the center?

01:18:30.910 --> 01:18:32.030
Are you balanced?

01:18:32.030 --> 01:18:33.230
Okay.
Do you have equanimity?

01:18:33.230 --> 01:18:34.063
Yes.

01:18:34.063 --> 01:18:34.950
Yeah, I do.

01:18:34.950 --> 01:18:35.930
Thank you.

01:18:35.930 --> 01:18:36.890
I didn't know what it meant,

01:18:36.890 --> 01:18:39.063
